This design was scaled using SCALE program
from 620-80H.YAG and has F/R better than 
20 dB and SWR less than 2:1 over entire 
2-m band, with mid-band free-space gain 
of 12.1 dBi. 

Experiment with changing the element lengths
to closest 1/8" values to see effect of
element tolerances.
